### Lab07 - books API client (run app first on :8080)
### 1. list
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books
Accept: application/json

### 2. one
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/1
Accept: application/json

### 3. missing -> 404 problem+json
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/999
Accept: application/json

### 4. create -> 201 + Location
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Domain-Driven Design",
  "author": "Eric Evans",
  "year": 2003,
  "genre": "TECH"
}

### 5. invalid -> 400 problem+json (empty title)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "author": "No Name",
  "year": 2020,
  "genre": "FICTION"
}

### 6. duplicate -> 409 (same title+author as existing)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Effective Java",
  "author": "Joshua Bloch",
  "year": 2018,
  "genre": "TECH"
}

### 7. replace -> 200
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Effective Java 3rd ed.",
  "author": "Joshua Bloch",
  "year": 2018,
  "genre": "TECH"
}

### 8. delete -> 204, second time -> 404
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/books/2

### 9. docs
GET http://localhost:8080/v3/api-docs
Accept: application/json
